    <h2 id="dpa">Data Processing Agreement (DPA)</h2>
    <p>This Data Processing Agreement (“DPA”) forms part of the Hightide Terms and Conditions and applies when you, as a User of the Hightide platform, collect, store, or process personal data relating to your own customers or clients (“Customer Data”) through the Platform.</p>

