      <li><strong>User</strong>: You, the business using Hightide.</li>
      <li><strong>Customer Data</strong>: Personal data about your clients/customers submitted to Hightide.</li>
      <li><strong>Data Controller</strong>: You, the User, who determines the purposes and means of processing Customer Data.</li>
      <li><strong>Data Processor</strong>: Us (Hightide), processing Customer Data on your behalf.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>2. Scope and Purpose</h3>
    <p>We will process Customer Data solely:</p>
